,"roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21118","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63156","characterName":"パイ猫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13192"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63156"},"originalCharacterName":"パイ猫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本名“パパイ・パイノパイ・パイキュパイン２３世”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラマージョの使い魔で、ご主人様に早く仲直りして欲しくて、直太朗に強力な魔法アイテムを売って協力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パン猫とは、同じ種族の女の子。もしかして、パン猫とのロマンスもある……かも？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13192","sourceWorkId":"11476","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78545e689d8dccfd013f2e923344457d778e622bce486252010aed4dd3233172.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2cd4a4b5e7da427e0c1e0b8dfb0e28a2cbc2075beaf8d61ecf695ba564e0d6bc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎津 まお","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21114","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63158","characterName":"グラマージョ・パイパイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58998","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229686"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13190"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63158"},"originalCharacterName":"グラマージョ・パイパイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称、宇宙最大最強の人妻魔女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に高圧的な態度で、魔法を持たない地球人を見下している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人妻に色目を使った夫“キュージ・パイパイ”に嫉妬。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全宇宙の人妻を支配下に置いて、二度と浮気心をくすぐらせないのが目的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手始めに宇宙最強の人妻戦隊がいる地球に赴く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美的感覚が独特で、直太朗をイケメンと認識してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法の呪文は「マジョマジョグランマ・パイパイナー」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"省略形で「パイパイナー！」だけでも使用可能。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13190","sourceWorkId":"11476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称・宇宙最大最強の人妻魔女。その名のとおりに非常にグラマーな肢体を、黒を基調にしたボンテージファッションに包んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし見た目や言動とは裏腹に、非常に一途で身持ちが堅く、夫であるキュージ・パイパイを誰よりも愛している。今回の騒動も、キュージが他の人妻に色目を使った（実際はチラ見しただけ）のが原因。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こうなれば宇宙の人妻という人妻を自分の支配下に置き、二度とキュージに色目なんか使わせないよ、フン！　という理由で、手始めに宇宙最強の人妻戦隊がいるという地球にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美的感覚が独特で、美形の礼よりも直太朗をイケメンと認識してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法の呪文は、マジョマジョグランマ・パイパイナー。省略形で、パイパイナー！　だけでも使用可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アタシは、宇宙最強の人妻魔女！　グラッ・マーーーーーーーーーー……………………ジョ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58998"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"35 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13190","sourceWorkId":"11476","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/896e6cac58cf80a5a5d80d64125cd71a91643ec66f5db5c585dac816b885eeaf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41c6951c48ed6c31606f28951032ac425454a8832845f95bf3a55209c7e3b540.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葉月 るい","creatorId":"vndb:s7810","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7810","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7810","name":"葉月るい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21130","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63159","characterName":"キュージ・パイパイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13191"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63159"},"originalCharacterName":"キュージ・パイパイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラマージョの夫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女とは宇宙魔術専門学校で知り合い、宇宙大四畳半で同棲ののち、結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直太朗と同じく、宇宙ヅマスキーである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・女性を見るときは、まず指輪を確認してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・見目麗しい子持ちの人妻がいれば、目で追ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・たぷたぷと肉のついたお尻が、大好きである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"などなど、直太朗と共通点が多く、会った瞬間に炎の友情で結ばれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"したがって魔力もシンクロしやすく、直太朗が魔法牌「ぱいぱいポン」を操れるのもそのため。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13191","sourceWorkId":"11476","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/963aa6d4210a6404beba5edd579ace3b9c9c7a63b598f6fe0e78acbb8c459fef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf0c47dda647945485a4a19b6f5963d8076c23377dd032640d645c9e015575bf.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鉄 滝次","creatorId":"vndb:s5677","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5677","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5677","name":"鉄 滝次","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21128","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c57151","characterName":"火村 杏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c57151"},"originalCharacterName":"火村 杏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"602"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"96"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents died early in life, and she has been the proprietress of a hot spring inn, Homura, since her twenties."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In front of Ippei and Ryouko, she speaks in an older sisterly manner. she can be a bit rough around the edges, but once in front of customers, she shows her perfect customer service with a calm and composed manner. She is also a karate expert, and even though he has retired from karate, he can still cut a beer bottle with her hand. So, although she could actually twist Tetsuji with one hand, she held back for fear that he might cause a serious injury to the young Ippei. Besides, she didn't want to raise her hand to a man she had fallen in love with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For whatever reason, she feels a little sad for Ippei, who has suddenly become withdrawn since he entered junior high school. She is also intensely frustrated by the lack of men in her life since her husband vanished ten years ago. Although she does not drown herself in it, she has a few adult toys hidden in the back of the mirror drawer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weakness is alcohol, and the mere smell of it makes her weak. On the day she accidentally drinks, her personality does a 180-degree turn and she becomes a crying baby."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57151"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f44ed55773ba24fb50e10b7eeb5c5e432390ae7ca1f850a06eef30b38174dcb9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.b